  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total Floor Covering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Dutch entrepreneur has proven himself to be a successful wholesaler of construction materials for decades. For several years this entrepreneur has been busy setting up a factory in Vietnam to produce his own invented felt material that can be used as floor protection board. This felt material is made from recycled textiles and is mainly used in construction by painters and plasterers to prevent staining and damaging of delicate surfaces.With a guarantee from DGGF and a loan from a Dutch bank the company is able to build an advanced manufacturing facility in Vietnam which will significantly improve its trade capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
